[-] Include released ClearHead in dev and worker images =image-clearhead $Darrion approved 2026-10-14: ClearHead is a core tool in our stack. One shared mkosi recipe and release pin/checksum, mandatory in dev-pod and sandbox-worker, installing released x86_64 Linux CLI at /usr/bin/clearhead during image build. Use forthcoming GitHub binary release v0.3.2 (specification v0.3.0), not per-project installers or host bind mounts. Fetch with TLS and verify archive checksum before installing, keep secrets/queries/workspaces outside images. Tests cover both role composition and checksum failure; real built worker smoke creates/reads/completes an action in temporary workspace. Existing platform development setup may override with its branch build. No agent-sandbox awareness of ClearHead, no distro snapshot/security/boot/service changes, no production installation/reboot. Facilitator verifies released digest and builds images before landing; dev OS rollout separately approved.$ !1 ^2026-10-14T00:53 #01a137e6-d718-7e02-afde-f14c66787f16
